# Optional: enable LIVE Google data.
# Create a Web-application OAuth Client ID in Google Cloud Console and add this
# site's origin to "Authorized JavaScript origins". Scopes:
#   gmail.readonly     - the inbox widgets and the briefing's live inbox
#   calendar.readonly  - the Weekly Briefing's live calendar
#   gmail.send         - optional, only for one-click Evernote filing
# One consent covers them all. Leave unset to run with sample data.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional: passcode-gate the app for everyone, not just per device.
# Set this to the SHA-256 of "nexus.passcode.v1:<your passcode>", e.g.
#   printf 'nexus.passcode.v1:my long passcode' | sha256sum
# Leave unset and each browser sets its own passcode on first use.
# NOTE: this hash ships inside the JS bundle and the pages are static, so it
# is a deterrent, not access control. Make the repo private for real privacy.
VITE_APP_PASSCODE_HASH=
